From: Xun2202 <98207886+Xun2202@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 15:22:14 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] library: add a panorama comfortable grid display mode (wide
 covers, staggered layout)

The panorama comfortable grid is added because the same layout in Anikku
was preferred for wide covers.

Library and browse gain a display mode that draws a cover in a 3:2 cell
when its height/width is at most 0.75, and lays those cells out in a
staggered grid whose automatic columns are 168 dp wide. Cover orientation
is cached for the process lifetime so a cell keeps its shape after it
scrolls off screen and back.

Harmony-only: ported from anikku-harmony 0015 + 0020 (KMK panorama cover feature reduced to the grid); Animeko has no such grid.
